<title>USA: FGIC qualifies six muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies six muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said Thursday it qualified for bond insurance the following six municipal issues scheduled for competive sale today:</p>
<p>--Kansas City, Kan., $10.7 million GO improvement.</p>
<p>--Mc Pherson County SD, Kan., $5.447 million school building GOs.</p>
<p>--Danvers, Mass., $5.218 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Averill Park CSD, N.Y., $7.590 million school improvement.</p>
<p>--Blind Brook-Rye UFSD, N.Y., $1.5 million school district bonds.</p>
<p>--Island Trees UFSD, N.Y., $5.7 million school district bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
